proton-autogen (3.1.9) noble; urgency=medium

  * Thanks to all users and contributors for their continued support, feedback and encouragement throughout the development of proton-autogen.
  * Added a complete manual page (man proton-autogen) with automatic documentation generation through help2man.
  * Added improved multilingual documentation support with external translation files.
  * Added new translations and updated help documentation for multiple languages including English, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Chinese, Ukrainian, Hindi and Arabic.
  * Improved internationalization architecture by moving user-facing documentation outside the Python source code.
  * Improved Gamescope integration with enhanced argument handling, scaling support and runtime stability.
  * Added automated tests for Gamescope functionality and command-line path handling.
  * Improved Proton-Call stability and backend command filtering.
  * Improved runtime handling and internal core module organization.
  * Reduced duplicated code and cleaned internal components for better maintainability.
  * Updated README documentation and project information.
  * General stability improvements and code cleanup.

